   102	#    - Condition (4) is the key combo check: it prevents the task from silently
   103	#      degenerating into D20-only hidden-start decoding.
   104	#
   105	# i) New solver assumptions and matching generator guarantees
   106	#    - Solver assumes the largest solid square is the destination; generator makes
   107	#      the destination the only solid square with size >= 2.
   108	#    - Solver assumes there is exactly one non-red border singleton (yellow source
